  </div>
</section>


<section class="philosophy-constellation">
  <h2 class="constellation-title">FOSS philosophy</h2>
  <div class="constellation">
    <div class="star-card">
      <div class="star-icon">✦</div>
      <h3>Freedom from Lock-In</h3>
      <p>Own Your Tech, Not Rent It<br>from pricey, closed systems to open tools your team controls, no subscriptions, no dependence.</p>
      <span class="meta">50 % average cost savings on software + maintenance</span>
    </div>
    <div class="star-card">
      <div class="star-icon-circle">⃝</div>
      <h3>Flexibility That Scales</h3>
      <p>Adapt Tools to Your Mission<br>Modify, remix, or expand open-source systems to fit your programs as they grow, from 10 users to 10 000.</p>
      <span class="meta">Scalable, adaptable, open tech that grows with your mission.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="star-card">
      <div class="star-icon">❁</div>
      <h3>Community That Sustains</h3>
      <p>Built by Many, For Everyone<br>Get constant improvements, peer support, and long-term reliability through global open-source communities.</p>
      <span class="meta">Supported by 200 k + users worldwide</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="pulse-section">
  <div class="pulse-grid">
    <div class="pulse-newsletter">
      <h3>We’re building tech that works for good. From grassroots innovation to open-source breakthroughs, our newsletter curates real stories, useful tools, and lessons from the field.</h3>
      <p>Join the movement, stay in the loop.</p>
      <form data-members-form="subscribe" class="pulse-form">
        <input data-members-email type="email" placeholder="you@nonprofit.org" required aria-label="Email address">
        <button type="submit">Subscribe</button>
      </form>
    </div>

    {{#get "posts" filter="tag:latest" limit="1" include="tags,feature_image"}}
      {{#foreach posts}}
